post.description:
Create a real-estate BuyerRequirement directly from the customer portal.

The authenticated portal identity supplies tenant/contact/account ownership;
the request body cannot choose another customer, staff assignee, or status.

patch.description:
Approves, rejects, or processes a refund request.
Note (Page 11 & 15): Platform Admin does NOT automatically have 'platform.refunds.manage';
only Billing and Platform Super Admin can approve/process refunds, and every action is recorded in audit logs.
